---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LogoMark from '../components/LogoMark.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="Bright Lives English teaches English through short, inspiring videos about real people. Here's why, and how it works.">
  <section class="wrap section about">
    <div class="intro">
      <LogoMark size={96} />
      <p class="eyebrow">About Bright Lives English</p>
      <h1>We believe the best way to learn a language is through the lives of real people.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Textbook dialogues are quickly forgotten. But a story about a young man who ran across a country on one leg, or a woman who planted millions of trees, stays with you. And when a story stays with you, so does the English.</p>
      <p>That's the idea behind Bright Lives English. Every week we tell a short, true story about someone who did something brave, kind or surprising, and we turn it into a complete English lesson:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>A video</strong> you can slow down, and replay one sentence at a time.</li>
        <li><strong>A transcript</strong> that follows the video, with the key words explained.</li>
        <li><strong>Flashcards</strong> to learn and remember the most useful words.</li>
        <li><strong>The Story Challenge</strong>, a quick game to check what you understood.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Everything is free, and you don't need an account. Your progress is saved on your own device.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>We're two English teachers, a husband and wife, and teaching is what we love most. In our classrooms we've always tried to do one thing: keep every lesson positive and bright. Bright Lives English is how we bring that feeling to learners everywhere, for free.</p>
      <p>We believe English matters more than ever. Ideas and information now move around the world in seconds, and English opens the door to so much of it. Everyone deserves a way in, whatever their budget.</p>
      <p>The idea for our lessons came from something we've always enjoyed: reading about remarkable people and what we can learn from them. Their stories have one thing in common. <strong>Nothing comes easy.</strong> Every one of them kept going when things were hard.</p>
      <blockquote>Learning English is not so different. It isn't easy for everyone, but it is rewarding for everyone.</blockquote>
      <p>So every story on this site carries two lessons: the English you need, and the reminder that you can get there, one step at a time.</p>

      <h2>Say hello</h2>
      <p>Have an idea for a story, or a person who inspires you? We'd love to hear it. Leave a comment on our <a href={SITE.youtube} target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube channel</a> or email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .intro h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.8vw, 52px);
  }
</style>
